#. Runtime JSON key: result_progress.operation_count_contract
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "编辑块、已执行命令、原生计数和请求的地图单元使用不同单位。成功返回的编辑块也可能包含部分结果。原生计数不能证明发生了多少次游戏变更；缺失值仍视为未知。 对于 world_editor batch，只有目标 step 自身设置 boolean 类型的 detail=true，且子结果提供进度元数据时，才保留完整的原始子结果。父级 detail 设置和字符串“true”不会启用此功能。默认 text 仍保留900字符的摘录；若要不受该摘录限制地检查成功的 ID 和 remainingAction，请明确请求完整结果。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.RESULT_PROGRESS.OPERATION_COUNT_CONTRACT"
msgid "Edit blocks, executed commands, native counters and requested map cells use separate units. A successful edit block can contain partial results. Native counters do not establish how many game changes occurred; missing values remain unknown. For world_editor batch, the individual step must set boolean detail=true, and the child must provide progress metadata, to retain the complete raw child result. The parent detail setting and the string \"true\" do not enable this. The default text keeps its 900-character excerpt; request the full result explicitly to inspect successful IDs and remainingAction without that excerpt limit."
msgstr "Edit blocks, executed commands, native counters and requested map cells use separate units. A successful edit block can contain partial results. Native counters do not establish how many game changes occurred; missing values remain unknown. For world_editor batch, the individual step must set boolean detail=true, and the child must provide progress metadata, to retain the complete raw child result. The parent detail setting and the string \"true\" do not enable this. The default text keeps its 900-character excerpt; request the full result explicitly to inspect successful IDs and remainingAction without that excerpt limit."

