msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.TOOLS.GAME_CONTROL.PARAMETERS.DIALOGTOKEN"
msgid "Opaque token returned by status for the current MOD mismatch dialog. Required for acknowledge and checked again before native invocation."
msgstr "Opaque token returned by status for the current MOD mismatch dialog. Required for acknowledge and checked again before native invocation."

#. Runtime JSON key: ui_dialog.ui_control_description
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "UI统一入口：domain=action/feedback/dialog/selection。支持允许的UI Action、玩家反馈、原生对话框status/acknowledge，以及按精确id操作复制人选择的status/select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.UI_DIALOG.UI_CONTROL_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Unified UI entrypoint: domain=action/feedback/dialog/selection. Supports allowed UI actions, player feedback, native dialog status/acknowledge, and exact-id duplicant selection status/select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down."
msgstr "Unified UI entrypoint: domain=action/feedback/dialog/selection. Supports allowed UI actions, player feedback, native dialog status/acknowledge, and exact-id duplicant selection status/select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down."

#. Runtime JSON key: ui_dialog.ui_domain_description
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "UI子系统：action、feedback、dialog或selection。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.UI_DIALOG.UI_DOMAIN_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "UI subsystem: action, feedback, dialog or selection."
msgstr "UI subsystem: action, feedback, dialog or selection."

#. Runtime JSON key: ui_dialog.ui_action_description
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "domain=action：list/trigger/open_management；domain=feedback：notification/popup/speech_bubble/marker；domain=dialog：status/acknowledge；domain=selection：使用精确id的被动status或显式select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down。selection的修改操作需要task及confirm=true；dryRun不调用UI。滚动仅针对已选复制人的UI；scroll_up/down各发送一次原生滚轮事件（+1/-1）并返回pending，不保证距离、完成或可见性。后续status或截图需显式请求。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.UI_DIALOG.UI_ACTION_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "domain=action: list/trigger/open_management; domain=feedback: notification/popup/speech_bubble/marker; domain=dialog: status/acknowledge; domain=selection: passive status or explicit select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down with exact id. Selection UI mutations require task and confirm=true; dryRun invokes no UI. Scroll requires the selected duplicant UI; scroll_up/down dispatches one native wheel event (+1/-1) and returns pending, without guaranteeing distance, completion or visibility. Request a later status or screenshot explicitly."
msgstr "domain=action: list/trigger/open_management; domain=feedback: notification/popup/speech_bubble/marker; domain=dialog: status/acknowledge; domain=selection: passive status or explicit select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down with exact id. Selection UI mutations require task and confirm=true; dryRun invokes no UI. Scroll requires the selected duplicant UI; scroll_up/down dispatches one native wheel event (+1/-1) and returns pending, without guaranteeing distance, completion or visibility. Request a later status or screenshot explicitly."

#. Runtime JSON key: ui_dialog.invalid_ui_domain
