#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "存在未通过放置预检的分组，未执行此地图请求。重试前请检查各组的 preflightResult。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.MAP_REQUEST_SUPPORT.PREFLIGHT_FAILED"
msgid "The map request was not executed because a group failed placement preflight. Inspect each preflightResult before retrying."
msgstr "The map request was not executed because a group failed placement preflight. Inspect each preflightResult before retrying."

#. Runtime JSON key: construction_mode.future_preflight_unavailable
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "请求的建造模式或材料规则尚未生效。只读预检不会切换游戏模式，因此该条件下的放置适用性仍未知。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.CONSTRUCTION_MODE.FUTURE_PREFLIGHT_UNAVAILABLE"
msgid "The requested construction or material policy is not active. A read-only preflight does not switch game modes; placement eligibility for that requested policy remains unknown."
msgstr "The requested construction or material policy is not active. A read-only preflight does not switch game modes; placement eligibility for that requested policy remains unknown."

#. Runtime JSON key: construction_mode.instant_consent_required
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "instantBuild=true 需要 allowSandbox=true 且 confirm=true"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.CONSTRUCTION_MODE.INSTANT_CONSENT_REQUIRED"
msgid "instantBuild=true requires allowSandbox=true and confirm=true"
msgstr "instantBuild=true requires allowSandbox=true and confirm=true"

#. Runtime JSON key: construction_mode.unsupported_preview_action
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "不支持的建造预检操作。请选择已公布的 planning action。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.CONSTRUCTION_MODE.UNSUPPORTED_PREVIEW_ACTION"
msgid "Unknown construction preview action; choose an advertised planning action."
msgstr "Unknown construction preview action; choose an advertised planning action."

#. Runtime JSON key: construction_mode.unsupported_sandbox_preview
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "所选沙盒操作不支持预检。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.CONSTRUCTION_MODE.UNSUPPORTED_SANDBOX_PREVIEW"
msgid "The selected sandbox action does not support preview."
msgstr "The selected sandbox action does not support preview."

#. Runtime JSON key: placement_candidates.max_evaluations
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "本次调用最多评估的放置锚点数。默认64，硬上限256。独立于返回limit和区域maxCells。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.PLACEMENT_CANDIDATES.MAX_EVALUATIONS"
msgid "Maximum anchors whose placement is evaluated in this call. Defaults to 64; hard maximum 256. Independent of returned limit and maxCells."
msgstr "Maximum anchors whose placement is evaluated in this call. Defaults to 64; hard maximum 256. Independent of returned limit and maxCells."

#. Runtime JSON key: placement_candidates.scan_offset
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "同一矩形内按行优先的锚点偏移。从0开始，默认0。用nextOffset继续；各页独立观察和排名。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.PLACEMENT_CANDIDATES.SCAN_OFFSET"
msgid "Zero-based row-major anchor offset within the same rectangle. Defaults to 0. Continue with nextOffset; each page is independently observed and ranked."
msgstr "Zero-based row-major anchor offset within the same rectangle. Defaults to 0. Continue with nextOffset; each page is independently observed and ranked."

#. Runtime JSON key: placement_candidates.limit
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "返回候选行数上限。默认8，最大50。这不限制放置评估的工作量。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.PLACEMENT_CANDIDATES.LIMIT"
msgid "Maximum candidate rows returned. Defaults to 8; hard maximum 50. This does not bound placement evaluation work."
msgstr "Maximum candidate rows returned. Defaults to 8; hard maximum 50. This does not bound placement evaluation work."

#. Runtime JSON key: placement_candidates.max_cells
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "请求矩形的单元格数上限。默认及硬上限为2500。评估工作量另由maxEvaluations限制。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.PLACEMENT_CANDIDATES.MAX_CELLS"
msgid "Maximum cells in the requested rectangle. Default and hard maximum 2500. Evaluation work is separately bounded by maxEvaluations."
msgstr "Maximum cells in the requested rectangle. Default and hard maximum 2500. Evaluation work is separately bounded by maxEvaluations."

#. Runtime JSON key: placement_candidates.scope_note
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "候选、排名和计数仅涵盖本次已评估窗口。bestCandidate只是该窗口内已观察到的最佳锚点；预检成功不保证本体放置或施工完成。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.PLACEMENT_CANDIDATES.SCOPE_NOTE"
msgid "Candidates, ranking and counts cover only this call's evaluated window. bestCandidate is the best observed anchor in that window; successful preview does not guarantee native placement or completed construction."
msgstr "Candidates, ranking and counts cover only this call's evaluated window. bestCandidate is the best observed anchor in that window; successful preview does not guarantee native placement or completed construction."

#. Runtime JSON key: placement_candidates.next_partial
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "仍有未观察的锚点。保持相同矩形和设置并指定scanOffset={0}；各页不是原子快照。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.PLACEMENT_CANDIDATES.NEXT_PARTIAL"
msgid "More anchors remain unobserved. Repeat the same rectangle and settings with scanOffset={0}; pages are not an atomic snapshot."
msgstr "More anchors remain unobserved. Repeat the same rectangle and settings with scanOffset={0}; pages are not an atomic snapshot."

#. Runtime JSON key: placement_candidates.no_viable
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "本窗口内未观察到可用锚点。请检查被拒绝的预检，或选择其他矩形或设置。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.PLACEMENT_CANDIDATES.NO_VIABLE"
msgid "No viable anchor was observed in this window. Inspect rejected previews or choose another rectangle or settings."
msgstr "No viable anchor was observed in this window. Inspect rejected previews or choose another rectangle or settings."

#. Runtime JSON key: placement_candidates.offset_error
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "此矩形的scanOffset必须在0到{0}之间。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.PLACEMENT_CANDIDATES.OFFSET_ERROR"
msgid "scanOffset must be between 0 and {0} for this rectangle."
msgstr "scanOffset must be between 0 and {0} for this rectangle."

#. Runtime JSON key: placement_candidates.invalid_rect
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "候选矩形无效：宽度和高度必须为正数。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.PLACEMENT_CANDIDATES.INVALID_RECT"
msgid "Invalid candidate rectangle: width and height must be positive."
msgstr "Invalid candidate rectangle: width and height must be positive."

#. Runtime JSON key: placement_candidates.area_too_large
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "区域过大: {0}x{1}={2}单元格，maxCells={3}"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.PLACEMENT_CANDIDATES.AREA_TOO_LARGE"
msgid "Area too large: {0}x{1}={2} cells, maxCells={3}"
msgstr "Area too large: {0}x{1}={2} cells, maxCells={3}"

#. Runtime JSON key: tools.building_control.parameters.maxEvaluations
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "本次调用最多评估的放置锚点数。默认64，硬上限256。独立于返回limit和区域maxCells。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.TOOLS.BUILDING_CONTROL.PARAMETERS.MAXEVALUATIONS"
msgid "Maximum anchors whose placement is evaluated in this call. Defaults to 64; hard maximum 256. Independent of returned limit and maxCells."
msgstr "Maximum anchors whose placement is evaluated in this call. Defaults to 64; hard maximum 256. Independent of returned limit and maxCells."

#. Runtime JSON key: tools.building_control.parameters.scanOffset
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "同一矩形内按行优先的锚点偏移。从0开始，默认0。用nextOffset继续；各页独立观察和排名。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.TOOLS.BUILDING_CONTROL.PARAMETERS.SCANOFFSET"
msgid "Zero-based row-major anchor offset within the same rectangle. Defaults to 0. Continue with nextOffset; each page is independently observed and ranked."
msgstr "Zero-based row-major anchor offset within the same rectangle. Defaults to 0. Continue with nextOffset; each page is independently observed and ranked."

#. Runtime JSON key: filter_preview.error.unsupported_preview
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "筛选器更改不支持 dryRun=true。请求已在访问目标前被拒绝，筛选器未更改。请用 list/detail 读取当前设置。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.FILTER_PREVIEW.ERROR.UNSUPPORTED_PREVIEW"
msgid "Filter changes do not support dryRun=true. The request was rejected before target access, and no filter changes were made. Use a list/detail read action to inspect the current filter."
msgstr "Filter changes do not support dryRun=true. The request was rejected before target access, and no filter changes were made. Use a list/detail read action to inspect the current filter."

#. Runtime JSON key: filter_preview.error.invalid_boolean
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "dryRun 必须是 JSON 布尔值。筛选器未更改。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.FILTER_PREVIEW.ERROR.INVALID_BOOLEAN"
msgid "dryRun must be a JSON boolean. No filter changes were made."
msgstr "dryRun must be a JSON boolean. No filter changes were made."

#. Runtime JSON key: filter_preview.parameter.dry_run
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "筛选器写入不支持预览。dryRun=true 会在访问或修改目标前被拒绝；仅在有意实际执行时省略或设为 false。list/detail 仅供读取。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.FILTER_PREVIEW.PARAMETER.DRY_RUN"
msgid "Filter writes do not support previews. dryRun=true is rejected before target access or mutation. Omit it or use false only for intended execution. The list/detail actions remain read-only."
msgstr "Filter writes do not support previews. dryRun=true is rejected before target access or mutation. Omit it or use false only for intended execution. The list/detail actions remain read-only."
